5	 *
6	 * <p>The {@link #checkDigit(String)} rule computes the standard Luhn check digit over the digits
7	 * contained in the code (non-digit characters, such as the formatting dashes, are ignored). It is the
8	 * single source of truth for the {@code checkDigit} response field exposed by {@code OwnerMapper}.
9	 */
