Defined in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Person.java` (field line 37, `getLastName()` line 47). Used by `AssignCustomerCode` (LAST3), `OwnerHousehold`, `CountNamesakes`, and `OwnerMapper` (displayName/initials).

